	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.0=This Book Contains Information about every Alloy, which can be created by using a Smelting Crucible.¶===================¶In order to make an Alloy you need to reach the Melting Point of the Alloy itself.
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.1=And you need to reach the Melting Point of all but one of its Components. You can ofcourse also melt all of the Components, but you are free to 'not melt' one of the Components.
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.2=In case you have to supply Air for the Crucible (for Steel), you need to point an Engine into it, which will act as a Fan. For Multiblock Crucibles the Engine has to be at the Bottom Row.
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.3=Alloy:¶铝矾土¶===================¶Melting: 1565 K¶Boiling: 3780 K¶===================¶Components per 9¶5 氧化铝¶2 熟铁¶18 黑曜石¶
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.4=Alloy:¶铝矾土¶===================¶Melting: 1565 K¶Boiling: 3780 K¶===================¶Components per 5¶5 铝¶2 熟铁¶18 熔岩¶
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.5=Alloy:¶信素¶===================¶Melting: 1353 K¶Boiling: 2735 K¶===================¶Components per 8¶1 铜¶2 银¶5 红色合金¶
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.6=Alloy:¶信素¶===================¶Melting: 1353 K¶Boiling: 2735 K¶===================¶Components per 8¶1 退火铜¶2 银¶5 红色合金¶
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.7=Alloy:¶信素¶===================¶Melting: 1353 K¶Boiling: 2735 K¶===================¶Components per 16¶1 铜¶5 斯特林银¶10 红色合金¶
	written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.8=Alloy:¶信素¶===================¶Melting: 1353 K¶Boiling: 2735 K¶===================¶Components per 16¶1 退火铜¶5 斯特林银¶10 红色合金¶
